{
  "version": 16,
  "variables": [],
  "tiles": {
    "0": {
      "type": "data",
      "title": "Pod restarts (cluster-wide)",
      "query": "timeseries restarts = sum(k8s.container.restarts), interval:1m",
      "visualization": "lineChart",
      "davis": {
        "enabled": false
      },
      "visualizationSettings": {
        "chartSettings": {
          "gapPolicy": "connect"
        },
        "thresholds": [],
        "singleValue": {
          "showLabel": true
        },
        "table": {
          "enableSparklines": false
        }
      }
    },
    "1": {
      "type": "data",
      "title": "Containers ready by namespace",
      "query": "timeseries ready = sum(k8s.container.ready), by:{k8s.namespace.name}, interval:1m",
      "visualization": "lineChart",
      "davis": {
        "enabled": false
      },
      "visualizationSettings": {
        "chartSettings": {
          "gapPolicy": "connect"
        },
        "thresholds": [],
        "singleValue": {
          "showLabel": true
        },
        "table": {
          "enableSparklines": false
        }
      }
    },
    "2": {
      "type": "data",
      "title": "CPU requested vs node allocatable (cores)",
      "query": "timeseries requested = sum(k8s.container.cpu_request), allocatable = sum(k8s.node.allocatable_cpu), interval:1m",
      "visualization": "lineChart",
      "davis": {
        "enabled": false
      },
      "visualizationSettings": {
        "chartSettings": {
          "gapPolicy": "connect"
        },
        "thresholds": [],
        "singleValue": {
          "showLabel": true
        },
        "table": {
          "enableSparklines": false
        }
      }
    },
    "3": {
      "type": "data",
      "title": "Deployments: desired vs available",
      "query": "timeseries desired = sum(k8s.deployment.desired), available = sum(k8s.deployment.available), interval:1m",
      "visualization": "lineChart",
      "davis": {
        "enabled": false
      },
      "visualizationSettings": {
        "chartSettings": {
          "gapPolicy": "connect"
        },
        "thresholds": [],
        "singleValue": {
          "showLabel": true
        },
        "table": {
          "enableSparklines": false
        }
      }
    },
    "4": {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Scope note\n\nThis mirrors *Tasklog - Infrastructure* in Grafana within what Dynatrace receives: **cluster state** from the collector's `k8s_cluster` receiver.\n\n- **Node/pod CPU & memory usage** ship to Elasticsearch (agent-mode collector) - by design, one usage consumer.\n- **Collector/Vector pipeline health** lives in Prometheus/Grafana.\n- Full host depth here would require OneAgent, excluded by the no-vendor-agent rule."
    }
  },
  "layouts": {
